---
// A Carton is shaped like a gem: an Entrypoint plus the directory beside it.
---

<section class="shape not-content" aria-labelledby="shape">
  <div class="words">
    <h2 id="shape">Shaped like a gem</h2>
    <p>A Carton is an Entrypoint, <code>billing.rb</code>, plus its Interior, the <code>billing/</code> directory beside it. That's the layout of a gem's <code>lib/</code> and a Zeitwerk namespace, so most code is already in shape.</p>
    <p>There is no manifest. A gem, a path gem, a directory, or a single file can be a Carton, and a Carton with a gemspec can leave the app as a published gem unchanged.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="tree" aria-label="Files in the billing Carton">
    <li class="entry"><span>billing.rb</span><em>Entrypoint: importable, exports Billing</em></li>
    <li class="dir"><span>billing/</span><em>Interior: loads inside the Carton</em></li>
    <li class="inner"><span>invoice.rb</span></li>
    <li class="inner"><span>tax.rb</span></li>
    <li class="inner"><span>models/charge.rb</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .shape {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 3.5rem 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 56rem) {
    .shape {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-h2);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-family: var(--carton-display);
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    max-width: 34rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  p code {
    font-size: 0.875em;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-bg-inline-code);
  }

  .tree {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--carton-panel-edge);
    background: var(--carton-panel);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
  }

  li {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
    padding-block: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-1);
  }

  li em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  }

  .entry span {
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .entry em {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  :root[data-theme='light'] .entry em {
    color: var(--sl-color-accent);
  }

  /* The Interior sits inside the boundary. */
  .dir {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 2px dashed var(--carton-boundary);
  }

  .inner {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--carton-boundary);
    margin-left: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
